ize uygun meslekler hakkında bilgi alın.</p> <div class="c-input-group u-flex margin-b20"> <button id="arama-buton" type="button" class="c-button"> <span id="buton-yazi"><i class="icon icon-search"></i></span> <img id="loading-gif" src="https://www.eleman.net/images/loading-spinner.gif" style="display:none;width:25px" alt=""></button> <div class="u-flex-grow-full" style="text-align:right"><input type="text" value="" name="aranan" id="aranan-kelime" class="c-form-control js-auto-complete" autocomplete="off" placeholder="Aradığınız Meslek"></div></div></div> <div class="l-grid__col l-grid__col--lg-6" style="margin:auto"><div class="u-full-width mobile-margin-t10"> <div class="meslekler-page-title-image"> <img src="https://cdn.eleman.net/img/meslekler-hero-image.webp" srcset="https://cdn.eleman.net/img/meslekler-hero-image@2x.webp 2x, https://cdn.eleman.net/img/meslekler-hero-image@3x.webp 3x" alt="Meslek ve Maaş Rehberi" title="Meslek ve Maaş Rehberi"></div></div></div></div></div></header> <div class="l-section l-section--gray u-pad-ends-small" style="padding-top:16px;">  <div class="l-section l-section--gray"> <div class="container"> <div class="c-box meslek_card"> <div class="c-box__body"> <div class="l-grid__col l-grid__col--md-12 "> <div class="l-grid"> <div class="l-grid__col l-grid__col--xs-12 "> <h3 class="u-clear-gap-top u-gap-bottom">Popüler Beyaz Yaka Meslekleri</h3></div></div></div> <div class="c-meslek c-comments--full js-meslek "><div class="meslek_web_box scroll_mobil_box"> <div class="first-button scroll_menu_item_link"><div class="" style="display:block"> <div class="u-flex-dir-column"> <a href="https://www.eleman.net/meslek/idari-asistan/maas" class=""> <img loading="lazy" class=" u-fit meslek_ana_img" src="https://cdn.eleman.net/meslek_img/6250_asistan.jpg" alt="İdari Asistan" data-qazy="true"/></a></div> <div class="u-flex-dir-column u-clear-gap u-gap-top-xsmall meslek_content_div"> <a href="https://www.eleman.net/meslek/idari-asistan/maas" class=